&lt;p data-start=&quot;1637&quot; data-end=&quot;1719&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;At least one year of general office experience (healthcare or hospice preferred)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
