&lt;p data-start=&quot;1836&quot; data-end=&quot;1892&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to multitask in a dynamic clinical environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
