&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Join VitalCaring – Where Your Passion Changes Lives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Founded in 2021, VitalCaring has become a leading provider of home health and hospice services nationwide. We’re committed to creating a culture where team members feel supported, valued, and empowered to make an impact every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Temporary Part-Time HR Generalist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Home Office HR team and support key HR operations and team member experiences across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
