&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make an Impact&lt;/strong&gt; – Support the teams who deliver exceptional patient care every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow Your Experience&lt;/strong&gt; – Gain exposure across HR operations, compliance, reporting, and employee relations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Broadly&lt;/strong&gt; – Partner with leaders and teams across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
