&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Process transactions and conduct audits to support compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
