&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Join our growing team!&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;We have a Full Time or Part Time &lt;strong&gt;Registered Nurse &lt;/strong&gt;opportunity open now doing Home Health Visits in the Indianapolis area.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This office cares for adult and geriatric patients in their private homes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
