&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Executes established client care plan and the physician’s plan of treatment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performs patient care and treatment including but not limited to, taking blood pressures reading, wound care, measure of vital signs, collection of blood samples, administration of prescribed medication, in accordance with the providers treatment plan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports any changes in the client’s condition to the nursing supervisor and physician; executes and properly documents any new doctor’s orders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accurately document observations and interventions pertaining to nursing care utilizing a state-of-the-art touch pad tablet&lt;/p&gt;
